<title>UK: Commerzbank unit sets 2.0 bln Luf bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank unit sets 2.0 bln Luf bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg, Generale</p>
<p>Bank and Commerzbank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK INTERNATIONAL SA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    20.AUG.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.45    PAY DATE  L-20.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 YIELD	 5.08 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 PAY FREQ    = PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES    L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
